<!-- RPA Deep Dive -->
<section id="rpa-deep-dive" class="py-5">
  <div class="container">
    <h3 class="mb-4 text-center">Strategic Contributions</h3>
    <br>
    <div class="card shadow-sm">
      <div class="card-header bg-primary text-white">
        <h3 class="mb-0">Building the Risk Profile Assessment (RPA) Platform</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <div class="text-center mb-4">
          <i class="fas fa-shield-alt fa-2x text-primary"></i>
        </div>
        <p class="fs-5 mb-4">
          As Product Owner for the Merchant Services Risk & Credit team, I led the definition of an internal underwriting tool designed to evaluate merchant risk, centralize decisioning, and reduce Wells Fargo's reliance on the external Fiserv platform.
        </p>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
          <li class="list-group-item">
            <strong><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt text-primary me-3"></i>Situation:</strong> Merchant risk analysis and underwriting workflows depended on an external system (Fiserv), creating vendor reliance and limiting Wells Fargo's ability to centralize risk decisioning internally.
          </li>
          <li class="list-group-item">
            <strong><i class="fas fa-tasks text-primary me-3"></i>Task:</strong> Define and own the MVP vision for an in-house risk intelligence platform that would support Credit Officers in underwriting and monitoring, and centralize risk decisioning in-house.
          </li>
          <li class="list-group-item">
            <strong><i class="fas fa-running text-primary me-3"></i>Action:</strong>
            <ul class="fa-ul fs-5">
              <li class="mb-2"><span class="fa-li"><i class="fas fa-square text-primary"></i></span>Defined the core domain model the tool evaluates — merchant information, risk exposure, risk rating, collateral, and credit approval amount.</li>
              <li class="mb-2"><span class="fa-li"><i class="fas fa-square text-primary"></i></span>Built out the risk rating framework across three dimensions: <strong>Borrower Quality Rating (BQR)</strong> for creditworthiness and repayment behavior, <strong>Collateral Quality Rating (CQR)</strong> for liquidity and enforceability of collateral, and <strong>Asset Quality Review (AQR)</strong> for portfolio-level asset performance and risk deterioration trends.</li>
              <li class="mb-2"><span class="fa-li"><i class="fas fa-square text-primary"></i></span>Incorporated key credit and exposure risk indicators — chargebacks, refunds, and Non-Delivery Exposure (NDX) — as fraud and failure signals feeding into RPA decisions.</li>
              <li class="mb-2"><span class="fa-li"><i class="fas fa-square text-primary"></i></span>Coordinated system architecture across identity/access (PingFederate, AIMS), data and storage (CAAMS/Teradata, ICMP, MSCD), and event-driven messaging via Kafka (MSCD → Kafka → MSOW).</li>
              <li class="mb-2"><span class="fa-li"><i class="fas fa-square text-primary"></i></span>Defined the Risk Profile API, Search Results API, and Decision Response API to expose underwriting data and decisioning outputs.</li>
              <li class="mb-2"><span class="fa-li"><i class="fas fa-square text-primary"></i></span>Partnered on PEGA case management design, working across both Cosmos (traditional UI) and Constellation (modern, API-driven, component-based) frameworks for underwriting workflows and risk officer review screens.</li>
              <li class="mb-2"><span class="fa-li"><i class="fas fa-square text-primary"></i></span>Mapped the full RPA case lifecycle: merchant data ingested → risk signals calculated (BQR/CQR/AQR) → RPA case generated → Credit Officer review → action taken (approve, adjust credit limit, flag risk, or escalate).</li>
              <li class="mb-2"><span class="fa-li"><i class="fas fa-square text-primary"></i></span>Established reporting on time-to-complete, bottleneck analysis, stoppage points, and case aging, plus operational visibility into open case volume and queue backlog.</li>
              <li class="mb-2"><span class="fa-li"><i class="fas fa-square text-primary"></i></span>Balanced RPA delivery with ongoing BAU work, including vulnerability fixes, system updates, and tech debt items (TCI) under Wells Fargo governance.</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li class="list-group-item">
            <strong><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-primary me-3"></i>Result:</strong> Delivered a clear MVP vision and functioning case lifecycle for RPA — giving Credit Officers a centralized, internally-owned tool for merchant risk decisioning and setting the foundation to move the team off Fiserv and onto an API-driven, in-house underwriting platform.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

